 cross-process, discovery/probe, platform/WSL (manual environment), auth, reset clock, end-to-end selection. WSL environment-blocked/manual smoke.\nTop risk: actual read-only whitelist only 3 providers, top cross vendor codex/codebuddy and claude not sole default, no cursor. Do I say codex review? depends Q1. Fine.\nM1 independent release 0.2.0 defects only decision. If milestone question asks grouping, decision can fix M1 independent only.\n\nShould have \"blocking\" perhaps all true because final plan cannot close without answers. User says must user answer. I can make 5 true. Might be too many but okay. Perhaps AC005 and milestone/test are decisions not necessarily blocking? User explicitly requires user answer, blocking true. Four blocking review closure means identity and AC semantics blocking. Q4 scope also must decide before implementation. Good.\n\nCould reduce to 4 questions by combine milestone and acceptance? Better five clear.\n\nShould valid JSON with Chinese strings, no unescaped newlines? JSON output can pretty printed. No code block. Values no comments. Ensure default exact option string. Long but okay. One-line summary only.\n\nI'll formulate with 5 questions and 7 decisions. I can use option labels A/B/C plus descriptions; default same string. Avoid quoting field with backticks okay. No raw newline in strings. Ensure schema keys etc.\n\nOne concern user asked \"最后只输出一个 JSON 对象\" means output only JSON. Yes.\n\nNo need mention unable etc.\n\nI'll produce.","signature":""}],"model":"kimi-k3.1-pro","role":"assistant","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"type":"message","usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0,"cache_creation_input_tokens":null,"cache_read_input_tokens":null,"cache_creation":null,"server_tool_use":null,"service_tier":null}},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"_requestId":"01a1b6193a807c5b8985e1bc63ec99bd","_messageId":"01a1b6193b5f71fa9413d3d7a25ddb3f","_meta":{"codebuddy.ai/conversationRequestId":"01a1b6193a807c5b8985e1bc63ec99bd","code